{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-账户、客户与资质\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于客户投放资质上传或更新，需将资质上传至对应同名资质类型，多份资质分开上传，一份完整资质的多张图片上传至一个资质id中。配合接口有【获取Access token】和【上传资质图片】。\",\"id\":\"advertiser.delivery_qualification.submit\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/advertiser/delivery_qualification/submit/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"1761501324513352\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"upload.qualification_image\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710599659532\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取图片附件ids\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"上传资质图片\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"1761501324513352\",\"title\":\"上传/更新投放资质（新版）\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-UePYmSeh\" id=\"link-0\">使用必看</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-NxMJmrHw\">该接口用于客户<span style=\"color: #cf1322;\"><strong>投放资质上传</strong></span>，请注意以下使用规则：</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-57L5Te0V\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dIQMbXWH\">需要将资质上传至对应的同名资质类型中，<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>资质类型选择错误将会被审核拒绝</strong></span>。若找不到对应的资质类型，可以上传至“其他资质”，详细的资质类型可选值见下方接口入参。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0X6uzNMP\">需要上传多份资质时，例如要上传三份肖像授权书，请将<span style=\"color: #cf1322;\"><strong>每一份</strong></span><strong>肖像授权书</strong><span style=\"color: #cf1322;\"><strong>分开上传</strong></span>，<span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>多份资质合并上传将会被审核拒绝。</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-l5VhPkpR\">对于一份完整资质的多张图片请上传至一个资质id中，例如一份经销授权书的3张图片内容</li></ol><ol data-id=\"oacb21b4-IV5S5JhH\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WCz1vIlB\"><span style=\"color: #d83931;\"><strong>错误方式</strong></span>：分3次调用接口，会导致资质接收不全而被拒绝</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LHefd6Fw\"><span style=\"color: #2ea121;\"><strong>正确方式</strong></span>：将一份完整的资质调一次接口上传至一个资质中，保证审核平台能够一次收到完整的资质内容</li></ol>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201760871203429384%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1HLQhAWR\" id=\"h346b9f0-1HLQhAWR\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-QuWncKQw\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/advertiser/delivery_qualification/submit/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/advertiser/delivery_qualification/submit/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1761501324513352\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-a45MHe3W\" id=\"h346b9f0-a45MHe3W\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-7QavhG6n\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-WSkSdh8J\" id=\"h346b9f0-WSkSdh8J\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZqmHjHQx\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4ECC8iji\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-dBFhIOfC\" id=\"h346b9f0-dBFhIOfC\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 221px;\" width=\"221\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-by5U4vdp\">客户账号ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qualifications</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BXoq4GjT\">投放资质信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qualification_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4jEHvFB8\">资质id，选填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4osQx84Y\">① 提交新资质时请传0，系统会在应答参数中返回生成的qualification_id </p><p data-id=\"p838747a-0B5RxtQY\"> ② 该接口允许您修改投放资质，因此如需修改，可传入qualification_id进行编辑</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qualification_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2VSQXGsO\"> 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-UL4SnQD0\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-05fDJjgD\"><code>AGENT_ARRANGEMENT</code> 营销代投协议</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ct93nEuv\"><code>AUTHORIZATION_CONTRACT</code> 委托加工/生产合同</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XIovRE0A\"><code>DISTRIBUTION_AUTHORIZATION</code> 经销授权书</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-rXlSx8eG\"><code>ICP_RECORD_AUTHORIZATION</code> icp域名备案/授权</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7xPaEA0k\"><code>OTHER_CERTIFICATION</code> 其他资质</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-n5p5IXJX\"><code>PATENT_CERTIFICATE</code> 专利证书</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Rk3GLE6h\"><code>PORTRAIT_AUTHORIZATION</code> 肖像授权书</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-K11cv9o4\"><code>QUALITY_REPORT</code> 鉴定/质检报告</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kie0S5h9\"><code>SOFTWARE_COPYRIGHT_REGISTRATION_CERTIFICATE</code> 软件著作权登记证书</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Z5CdebtQ\"><code>TRADEMARK_REGISTRATION_CERTIFICATE</code> 商标注册证</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NvIcxyEF\"><code>VIDEO_MATERIAL_PRODUCTION_IP_AUTHORIZATION</code> 营销视频/素材/作品/IP授权</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">attachment_ids</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3n2qfJh9\">图片附件ids，通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710599659532\" target=\"_blank\">上传资质图片</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-aPHg6J1c\" id=\"h346b9f0-aPHg6J1c\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fadvertiser%2Fdelivery_qualification%2Fsubmit%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20